                                    <locus target="89v"/>
                                    <desc type="GuestText">Note written upside down listing the districts of the Kunama in four columns arranged 
                                        according to the cardinal directions.</desc>
                                    <q xml:lang="it">Distretti dei <sic>Cunamas</sic>
                                        est: alfa - afalo, badecom, alemme, betran, bazena (maidaro); centro: ghinaba, aimasa, cullucu, fode viano (?) cullucu,
                                        selest logodat; ouest: anal, sogodas, elit; sud: tica</q>
                                </item>
